# Drata GRC skills — public marketplace.
#
# This repository contains exactly one thing: the customer-facing Drata plugin.
# Team Interface owns it, so Interface owns every path. Combined with branch
# protection ("Require review from Code Owners"), this makes Interface approval
# mandatory on every PR — including the ones opened automatically by the
# promotion workflow in drata/ai-plugins.
#
# Unlike the internal marketplace, enabling code-owner review here has no blast
# radius: there is no other team's code in this repository to slow down.

* @drata/interface

# Security-sensitive files: Security owns the controls, not the code they protect
/.github/CODEOWNERS @drata/security-mergers
/.llm/security/ @drata/security-mergers
/SECURITY.md @drata/security-mergers
/.github/dependabot.yml @drata/security-mergers
/.github/workflows/security-*.yml @drata/security-mergers
/.github/workflows/security-*.yaml @drata/security-mergers
/.semgrep* @drata/security-mergers
/.gitleaks* @drata/security-mergers
/.socket* @drata/security-mergers
